Id: tig001e
Severity: ERROR
Category: tigris
Check: tigercron

Tigercron, the cron driver, cannot read its control file (cronrc), so no
scheduled check can run. The file is missing, or its permissions keep
the cron user out. Restore cronrc from the distribution or a backup,
make it readable by root and writable by nobody else, and the next
scheduled run will proceed.
